      "content": "it's just hard to see the \"healing\" part when everything feels so broken. it feels so selfish to keep taking up space and their energy when i'm not even contributing anything good. if i just wasn't here, they could finally just breathe and move on without having to worry about me or my mistakes. wouldn't it be more compassionate to just let them go?",
